{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o012a","title":"刘备向吕布求和取回妻子","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o012a-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备向吕布求和，吕布归还其妻子。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o012a-q"]},{"id":"xianzhu-a-p010-yingxiong","label":"《英雄记》","text":"《英雄记》补记刘备军在广陵饥困，相互啖食，遂向吕布请降；吕布送回其妻子及部曲家属。","evidence":["xianzhu-q-p010-yingxiong"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"求和","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o012a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"还其妻子","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o012a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":196,"label":"下邳失守后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y196","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o010","basis":"下邳失守后"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o012a-q","xianzhu-q-o010","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"]},"source_order":[32,59,"O012a"],"order":6515}],"persons":[{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0088","name":"吕布","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o012a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-23091cb2f781a2e55b22","layer":"original","quote":"先主求和于吕布，布还其妻子。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":58,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o010","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-41f463c31e36d9086831","layer":"original","quote":"袁术来攻先主，先主拒之于盱眙、淮阴〖10〗。曹公表先主为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。是岁，建安元年也。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48},{"id":"xianzhu-q-p010-yingxiong","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-972a0f4908f78e3f05f2","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《英雄记》曰：“备军在广陵，饥饿困踧；吏士大小，自相啖食，穷饿侵逼；欲还小沛，遂使吏请降布。布令备还州，并势击术。具刺史车马、童仆，发遣备妻子、部曲家属于泗水上，祖道相乐。”","attribution":"《英雄记》","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-697a3f2e328d102ae256","start":0,"end":90}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
